Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.83,0:00:07.16,TL,,0,0,0,,巴黎 阿尔卡拉斯拿到赛季第五冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.16,0:00:10.06,TL,,0,0,0,,可在几个月前 他还因为右腕受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:12.44,TL,,0,0,0,,错过了法网和温网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.89,0:00:14.78,TL,,0,0,0,,回到年初的澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:17.36,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛对兹维列夫 先赢两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:20.12,TL,,0,0,0,,又被追平 其间一度抽筋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:23.52,TL,,0,0,0,,打了{\fs78}5{\fs68}个多小时 他才闯进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.97,0:00:25.99,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网决赛 他先丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.99,0:00:28.93,TL,,0,0,0,,再连赢{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘击败德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:31.40,TL,,0,0,0,,首夺澳网 {\fs78}22{\fs68}岁的他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:33.14,TL,,0,0,0,,成为男单历史最年轻的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:35.51,TL,,0,0,0,,生涯全满贯得主
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:38.21,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}月多哈 两盘击败菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.21,0:00:39.91,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下赛季第二冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.91,0:00:41.67,TL,,0,0,0,,开年的两站巡回赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.67,0:00:44.03,TL,,0,0,0,,他都带着冠军离开
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.47,0:00:47.23,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}月 印第安维尔斯止步{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:49.70,TL,,0,0,0,,迈阿密第三轮输给科达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.70,0:00:51.34,TL,,0,0,0,,来到蒙特卡洛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:53.64,TL,,0,0,0,,又被辛纳两盘击败
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:05.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's Sinner that reigns supreme in Monte Carlo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N辛纳称雄蒙特卡洛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:08.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}[Final score announced]{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N【现场报出最终比分】
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.26,0:01:11.55,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}接下来 右手腕受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:13.46,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}巴塞罗那赢下首轮后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.46,0:01:14.99,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}他退出了下一轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:17.73,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}随后也错过法网和温网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.18,0:01:21.01,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}个多月后 他在美网复出
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:24.09,TL,,0,0,0,,打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强之后 与谢尔顿拼满{\fs78}5{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.09,0:01:26.89,TL,,0,0,0,,最后在决胜盘抢十落败
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.72,0:01:43.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}[Match result announced]{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N【主裁宣布比赛结果】
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.17,0:01:45.29,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月{\fs78}16{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.29,0:01:48.12,TL,,0,0,0,,他连续第五年锁定年终资格
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.12,0:01:51.32,TL,,0,0,0,,可伤停后的赛季 还没有结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.77,0:01:54.54,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月东京 两盘击败莱赫奇卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.54,0:01:57.31,TL,,0,0,0,,他拿下复出后的首个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:02:00.25,TL,,0,0,0,,上海第三轮负于贝尔赫斯后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.25,0:02:02.89,TL,,0,0,0,,他在维也纳两盘击败德米纳尔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.89,0:02:04.51,TL,,0,0,0,,再添一冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.01,0:02:07.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So I'm just really happy that at the end,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.91,0:02:10.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I found my way and just played great.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最终找到了办法 也打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.19,0:02:12.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And obviously it's been a really emotional{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一周让我感慨万千
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:14.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and an amazing week for me{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也非常美妙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.43,0:02:16.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that I learned a lot, you know,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我也学到了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.01,0:02:20.39,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to keep going forward step by step,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N继续一步一步向前走
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.39,0:02:21.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}playing on indoor courts,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在室内场上比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.47,0:02:24.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}trying to gain more confidence playing on this surface.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N努力在这种场地上积累信心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.91,0:02:26.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So I'm just really happy{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N所以我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.33,0:02:28.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and looking forward for the rest of the season.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也期待赛季接下来的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.73,0:02:30.22,TL,,0,0,0,,巴黎{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.22,0:02:32.84,TL,,0,0,0,,他先丢一盘 逆转弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:35.77,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛再遇谢尔顿 这次两盘赢球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.77,0:02:38.55,TL,,0,0,0,,首次夺得巴黎大师赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.85,0:02:58.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Carlos Alcaraz wins the Rolex Paris Masters{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯赢得巴黎大师赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.25,0:03:01.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for the very first time in his career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是他生涯第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:10.56,TL,,0,0,0,,截至{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}9{\fs68}日 {\fs78}6100{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:12.40,TL,,0,0,0,,赛季积分榜第三
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:13.50,TL,,0,0,0,,辛纳已退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:16.78,TL,,0,0,0,,高亮的是本届年终的{\fs78}8{\fs68}位正选
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.23,0:03:19.54,TL,,0,0,0,,去年在都灵收获亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.54,0:03:22.14,TL,,0,0,0,,今年带着巴黎大师赛冠军回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.14,0:03:24.47,TL,,0,0,0,,你看好他走到哪一步？
